@host = http://localhost:3000
@basicAuth = YWRtaW46c3VwZXJzZWN1cmVwYXNzd29yZA==

### Consultar tipo de línea (Lookup)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/verify/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{basicAuth}}

{
  "phoneNumber": "7225428819"
}

### Enviar código de verificación (SMS - flujo productivo)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/verify/send-code
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{basicAuth}}

{
  "phoneNumber": "+527225494079"
}

### Enviar código de verificación (llamada - landline)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/verify/send-code
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{basicAuth}}

{
  "phoneNumber": "7225428819",
  "channel": "call"
}

### Verificar código
POST http://localhost:3000/api/verify/verify-code
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{basicAuth}}

{
  "phoneNumber": "+527225494079",
  "code": "433844"
}
